### Environment Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiVersion = api
@testUserId = test-user-123
@testUserId2 = test-user-456
@adminUserId = admin-user-789

### Common Headers
@contentType = application/json
@multipartType = multipart/form-data

### Test Data
@validEmail = test@example.com
@invalidEmail = invalid-email
@futureDate = 2025-09-01
@pastDate = 2024-01-01
@invalidDate = invalid-date

### File Paths (update these to match your system)
@testPdfFile = ./test_files/sample_document.pdf
@testImageFile = ./test_files/sample_image.jpg
@largePdfFile = ./test_files/large_document.pdf

### Dynamic Variables (will be set from responses)
# @applicationId = set from create application response
# @documentId = set from upload document response
# @internshipId = set from create internship response
# @incubationId = set from create incubation response
# @pfeId = set from create pfe response
